# Opening Overdue while zoomed into an overdue task focuses that task's entry.
file <<END
Work:
	- One @due({today-1})
	- Two @due({today-1})
	- Three @due({today-1})
END
keys j j j .
see › Three
keys gO x
see Overdue
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- One @due({today-1})
	- Two @due({today-1})
	- Three @due({today-1}) @done({today})
END
